  FROZEN = the dose-0 direction re-injected into this dose, best over the same
  coefficient grid. It separates 'the coupling is destroyed' (frozen goes negative
  too) from 'mean-diff stopped finding it' (frozen stays positive while refit does
  not). Threshold is 0.00, same convention as the refit column.

